00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:31.900
Sarah: When you get to the final interview, a lot of
people just have this misconception that they have to

00:11:31.900 --> 00:11:37.930
be really good in tech, and the interview, which is
centered around like leet coding questions. Actually,

00:11:37.930 --> 00:11:43.720
the answer is not really I've had engineers who maybe
